WEBVTT

00:06.137 --> 00:07.139
Taiyo here.

00:07.139 --> 00:09.603
<i>I'm about to breach
the entrance to the deepest chamber.</i>

00:09.853 --> 00:11.105
Listen up, Taiyo.

00:11.105 --> 00:14.278
I'm going to disable the detonation system
within the next five minutes.

00:14.278 --> 00:17.744
After five minutes,
smash the tanks inside to kingdom come!

00:18.245 --> 00:19.205
Roger that!

00:21.459 --> 00:24.131
Hazakura is easily denatured,
and it's quick to vaporize.

00:24.800 --> 00:27.388
Exposing it to air should neutralize it.

00:27.722 --> 00:29.433
Be safe, all right, Taiyo?

00:29.935 --> 00:31.062
<i>Thanks, Mutsumi!</i>

00:55.444 --> 00:59.118
Since there's always the risk
of malfunction with electrical attacks,

00:59.118 --> 01:01.205
you were right to opt for close combat.

01:01.205 --> 01:02.333
Ouch.

01:03.126 --> 01:05.213
Surrender… Kawashita!

01:08.386 --> 01:10.223
Even if you increase
your defensive power,

01:10.223 --> 01:12.227
you can't block Kurosawa's blades.

01:12.937 --> 01:16.110
I've pierced your vital organs
with poisonous blades.

01:16.612 --> 01:19.701
Massive blood loss
will blunt your Yozakura powers.

01:19.910 --> 01:22.122
If you stop the bleeding right now,
that will save you--

01:23.249 --> 01:26.422
Big Sis Shion will be shutting down
the detonation system any second now.

01:26.924 --> 01:29.846
Holding you off until then,
that's my mission!

01:30.305 --> 01:33.688
Oh, please.
You straight arrows are such a pain.

01:46.880 --> 01:49.427
<i>What's this scenery I'm seeing?</i>

02:05.292 --> 02:14.853
MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY

03:22.487 --> 03:28.416
PLAN 26
OLD BLOOD

03:29.376 --> 03:31.965
They say that the archipelago bases
were wiped out.

03:31.965 --> 03:34.596
It's just a matter of time
before this one's history as well.

03:35.096 --> 03:37.644
Both Miya-san and Yama-san are dead.

03:38.144 --> 03:40.691
Too bad. Yama-san had a son, too.

03:41.860 --> 03:42.820
Huh?

03:44.741 --> 03:48.081
This dandelion's still alive, huh?

03:48.582 --> 03:50.628
How many years ago did we pick it?

03:50.628 --> 03:54.301
With no water, here in the shadows.
How amazing.

03:55.261 --> 04:00.313
The life forms around me
have no need for water or sunlight.

04:00.815 --> 04:03.529
Again, I'm struck
by how terrifying your powers are.

04:03.529 --> 04:07.035
They might have changed the tide of
the war if we'd been able to harness it.

04:07.494 --> 04:08.454
But…

04:09.039 --> 04:10.626
it's too late now.

04:11.210 --> 04:14.091
ON HOLD
I'm sure they're going to
erase this lab's existence…

04:14.592 --> 04:17.557
so that it won't put the higher-ups
at a disadvantage in court.

04:18.391 --> 04:21.898
My only regret is that I couldn't produce
any results from my research.

04:22.859 --> 04:25.029
That blood of yours is just too potent.

04:25.823 --> 04:29.079
I'm going to be erased, while you'll
be heading back to incarceration.

04:29.581 --> 04:33.004
In lieu of a farewell toast,
let me examine you one last time.

04:33.004 --> 04:35.509
It's not the last time.

04:35.509 --> 04:37.345
We can still make it.

04:37.345 --> 04:40.477
Let's come up with a strategy
and live on together.

04:40.728 --> 04:43.942
I tip my cap to you for being
so positive this late in the game.

04:44.234 --> 04:45.780
Why wouldn't I be?

04:45.780 --> 04:49.537
Thanks to this war, I was liberated,

04:49.537 --> 04:52.585
and through you,
I got to learn about this world.

04:53.085 --> 04:56.092
I'm going to take this golden opportunity
to be reborn.

04:56.635 --> 04:57.929
SOMEININE AMOUNT

04:57.929 --> 05:00.601
Reborn, eh? Into what?

05:00.935 --> 05:02.647
It can be anything.

05:03.189 --> 05:04.776
As long as I'm not a Yozakura.

05:06.153 --> 05:08.826
I've had enough of being stared at
like a cherry blossom tree,

05:08.826 --> 05:11.748
of being worshipped and trifled with.

05:12.290 --> 05:14.211
Like something small and insignificant.

05:14.211 --> 05:17.050
Like a dandelion,
which can be found everywhere.

05:17.217 --> 05:19.848
That's it, like a dandelion.

05:20.348 --> 05:22.645
I want to become an ordinary person.

05:23.145 --> 05:24.524
That would be possible

05:24.524 --> 05:27.530
with this "Seed-Sowing Project"
you're always talking about, right?

05:28.991 --> 05:30.744
That's nothing more than a hypothesis.

05:30.744 --> 05:32.497
Actually, it's a fantasy.

05:33.165 --> 05:34.836
You shouldn't take it at face value.

05:35.295 --> 05:37.257
Even if it's a fantasy, it's still lovely.

05:37.758 --> 05:42.225
When the history and existence of
the Yozakuras are completely obliterated,

05:42.225 --> 05:43.060
then finally…

05:44.146 --> 05:47.612
I'll be released from being
the first head of the Yozakura family.

05:49.031 --> 05:51.953
I can just be Tsubomi Yozakura.

05:52.955 --> 05:54.876
I'll see to it that it happens.

05:55.586 --> 05:59.134
Even if I have to sacrifice
all of my descendants.

06:10.950 --> 06:12.703
That's Mizuki's poison.

06:12.703 --> 06:14.164
Brings back memories, doesn't it?

06:20.928 --> 06:23.517
What the heck was that just now?

06:24.059 --> 06:26.188
The blood of the heads
resonated with each other,

06:26.188 --> 06:28.276
and our Bloomings spun out of control.

06:28.276 --> 06:31.490
Feels like something digging
into your brain, doesn't it?

06:32.242 --> 06:34.706
A certain special person
had a special goal

06:34.706 --> 06:37.210
for which she needed
the lives of her descendants,

06:37.210 --> 06:40.049
who had her special blood in their veins.

06:40.551 --> 06:42.429
The second, third, fifth generations…

06:42.930 --> 06:44.726
though the materials were available,

06:44.726 --> 06:47.732
back then, the technology was lacking.

06:48.567 --> 06:51.447
With the ninth generation,
there was finally a ray of hope.

06:54.996 --> 06:56.081
Just one more.

06:56.583 --> 06:59.964
If we can get our hands
on one more young, strong Yozakura body,

06:59.964 --> 07:02.093
her dream will become a reality.

07:02.803 --> 07:05.266
You probably have no idea
what I'm talking about,

07:05.266 --> 07:07.062
but there's no need for you to understand.

07:07.312 --> 07:09.942
Even if you were to stop me
and the Seed-Sowing Project,

07:09.942 --> 07:12.447
it would end nothing.

07:14.827 --> 07:16.706
"STABBING RAIN"

07:27.102 --> 07:29.481
Ouch.

07:29.481 --> 07:32.070
Not bad, Taiyo Asano.

07:32.905 --> 07:34.534
No, I don't get it.

07:37.038 --> 07:38.207
Not the past.

07:39.334 --> 07:41.380
Not what happened to the Yozakura family.

07:42.090 --> 07:43.635
I don't understand.

07:43.635 --> 07:48.979
And to be honest, I don't even know
for sure what you are to the Yozakuras.

07:49.647 --> 07:50.899
But the one thing I do know…

07:51.734 --> 07:53.947
is that you killed my family…

07:54.489 --> 07:57.370
and that you're still going after Mutsumi.

07:58.205 --> 08:00.544
So there's only one answer.

08:01.044 --> 08:04.510
Kawashita, I'm going to stop you!

08:07.056 --> 08:11.273
The pain is quite intense, you know,
regenerating.

08:16.951 --> 08:19.624
So the blood's circulated?

08:20.751 --> 08:22.546
When our bodies made contact,

08:22.546 --> 08:25.552
I infused you with the old,
thick Yozakura blood in my veins.

08:26.053 --> 08:29.769
As its components differ here and there
from that of the current Yozakura blood…

08:30.478 --> 08:35.906
it triggers anaphylaxis in bodies that are
already acclimated to Yozakura blood.

08:36.699 --> 08:39.580
It's a deadly poison that only hurts you.

08:40.958 --> 08:42.836
Compared to this toxin,

08:42.836 --> 08:46.134
the Seed-Sowing Project
is like a walk in the park.

08:47.136 --> 08:49.642
The physical side effects are minimal,

08:49.642 --> 08:51.604
and through repeated
biological concentration

08:51.604 --> 08:53.482
and genetic inheritance processes,

08:53.482 --> 08:55.779
little by little,
the brain and body evolve.

08:56.405 --> 08:59.578
When the individual becomes stronger,
there's less dependence on society,

08:59.578 --> 09:02.375
meaning that strife and sorrow
can be lessened.

09:03.085 --> 09:06.174
The side effects of sudden changes,

09:06.174 --> 09:08.555
I knew them all too well
thanks to that war.

09:09.431 --> 09:13.063
I was sure that the Yozakura power
could change the world.

09:13.606 --> 09:16.278
That's why I staked everything
on that woman.

09:17.948 --> 09:20.244
You and I are the same.

09:20.704 --> 09:24.712
Insignificant beings
at the mercy of the Yozakura family.

09:29.805 --> 09:32.645
All those tens of thousands of people
sacrificed by the Yozakuras,

09:32.645 --> 09:34.397
I've seen them come and go all this time.

09:35.316 --> 09:38.364
Human experiments,
those targeting the blood,

09:38.364 --> 09:40.786
those who joined forces with them,
only to be killed,

09:40.786 --> 09:42.581
those who were used by them.

09:44.167 --> 09:45.252
Stop it--

09:45.629 --> 09:48.968
Now, now, if you get rattled,
it'll consume you even faster.

09:51.933 --> 09:53.978
You're another man to be pitied.

09:54.437 --> 09:57.402
Robbed of the people we cherished,
thanks to the Yozakuras,

09:57.694 --> 10:00.032
then given a reason to live
by the Yozakuras…

10:00.575 --> 10:04.667
your life was all about being toyed with
by the Yozakuras. That's it.

10:04.667 --> 10:08.508
As another who's been drawn in by that
cursed family, let me show you some mercy.

10:09.217 --> 10:12.641
I'm going to end
your pointless suffering right now.

10:12.641 --> 10:14.477
-Taiyo!
-Big Bro Taiyo!

10:15.730 --> 10:16.941
-Taiyo.
-Big Bro!

10:27.211 --> 10:28.673
Good night…

10:30.969 --> 10:32.388
Taiyo Asano.

10:43.912 --> 10:46.876
SKELETON ISLAND
KAWASHITA CLINIC BASEMENT

10:47.628 --> 10:49.965
We appreciate all your hard work
'til now, Kawashita.

10:49.965 --> 10:53.096
It's been decided that we're going
to hand her over to an enemy nation.

10:53.806 --> 10:56.604
In exchange
for her substantial research value,

10:56.604 --> 10:59.735
we can save many of the top brass
from being hauled into court.

11:00.570 --> 11:06.541
Since it was all top-secret, we'll have
to erase this lab and you, its researcher.

11:07.041 --> 11:08.670
It's all for the sake of our country.

11:08.670 --> 11:10.172
Forgive us.

11:12.426 --> 11:14.682
I'm the one who should be sorry.

11:16.393 --> 11:20.861
I've decided to take her
into my own custody.

11:45.284 --> 11:47.288
You're unscathed,
even after that explosion?

11:47.789 --> 11:49.585
I have to say, you're pretty terrifying.

11:50.754 --> 11:52.883
But now you're free.

11:53.593 --> 11:56.431
You can take off wherever you want.

11:57.224 --> 12:00.272
You certainly are a strange man.

12:01.692 --> 12:04.990
As the head of the lab,
you worked so methodically,

12:04.990 --> 12:09.248
sacrificing hundreds of test subjects
to my blood.

12:10.042 --> 12:14.969
And now you've set me free
at the cost of your own life.

12:15.804 --> 12:17.223
Why would you do that?

12:18.601 --> 12:21.272
There is no reason, really.

12:23.193 --> 12:28.538
I grew up on this island, where everyone
was wiped out by the Spanish flu.

12:29.330 --> 12:32.754
My upbringing had something to do with
the fact that I went on to study medicine,

12:32.754 --> 12:36.846
but the job they gave me
was to slice up and dispose of people.

12:37.514 --> 12:40.310
And both the battlefields
and the mainland…

12:40.812 --> 12:43.568
were riddled with starvation and corpses.

12:44.402 --> 12:48.160
We were all born
into this world of despair…

12:48.870 --> 12:50.874
and we only had death ahead of us.

12:53.211 --> 12:55.466
But… you're different.

12:56.510 --> 13:00.434
In genetics,
you're what they call a mutation, see.

13:00.935 --> 13:04.735
A being who's more or less on the front
lines of the history of human evolution.

13:05.235 --> 13:10.412
Someday, if people like you were to become
the rule rather than the exception,

13:10.412 --> 13:14.713
this idiotic history of ours
might well see some improvement.

13:15.422 --> 13:19.138
Though that's way, way off in a future
that I can barely fathom now.

13:20.517 --> 13:25.400
Either way, I'm not likely
to get a chance to see that future come.

13:29.075 --> 13:31.956
Use the escape boat
on the western shore to--

13:31.956 --> 13:33.626
I'd like you to see it.

13:34.210 --> 13:35.964
Come with me.

13:38.051 --> 13:40.264
Through my will alone,

13:40.264 --> 13:42.644
I can bestow the power
of my Yozakura blood upon you.

13:43.896 --> 13:45.357
This future that you mentioned…

13:45.859 --> 13:49.156
in which someone like myself
is completely ordinary…

13:51.202 --> 13:55.043
I'd like you to show it to me, please.

13:57.549 --> 14:01.515
And so we concealed ourselves
in the shadows of history.

14:02.016 --> 14:07.484
And in order to make our shared vision of
the future a reality, we created Tanpopo.

14:09.488 --> 14:11.451
You understand now, don't you?

14:12.077 --> 14:15.375
What I mean
when I say that we're the same.

14:16.712 --> 14:18.465
If your heart and lungs stop functioning,

14:18.465 --> 14:20.678
it will prevent the someinine
from circulating.

14:20.678 --> 14:22.641
You won't be able
to achieve Blooming, either.

14:23.099 --> 14:24.645
Rest in peace now.

14:24.645 --> 14:26.649
You gave it your best shot.

14:27.859 --> 14:31.199
<i>I can hear him faintly…</i>

14:31.700 --> 14:33.621
<i>but I have no strength.</i>

14:34.288 --> 14:37.086
<i>I know that I have to stand up.</i>

14:37.086 --> 14:39.758
<i>But for an instant,
the thought crossed my mind.</i>

14:40.760 --> 14:43.431
<i>All the pain of my past,
this battle right now…</i>

14:43.891 --> 14:47.106
<i>if it means that I'll
be freed from them all,</i>

14:47.106 --> 14:49.778
<i>then maybe it wouldn't be so bad
if it all ended here and now.</i>

14:50.487 --> 14:53.786
<i>For an ordinary person,
I put up a good fight, didn't I?</i>

14:53.786 --> 14:56.667
<i>It seemed that way to me.</i>

14:58.963 --> 15:01.719
I'm really close
to disabling the detonation system.

15:07.814 --> 15:11.404
<i>Taiyo… don't let him win!</i>

15:12.574 --> 15:14.118
<i>I'm here for you.</i>

15:16.707 --> 15:21.800
From your flesh and bones, to your
someinine-laden blood and tissue fluids…

15:22.301 --> 15:24.639
I will annihilate it all.

15:25.390 --> 15:27.562
So you won't even pine
for this life anymore.

15:29.273 --> 15:31.069
It's over now.

15:33.364 --> 15:36.245
And now just take it easy.

15:39.293 --> 15:41.464
<i>Listen, Taiyo.</i>

15:41.882 --> 15:44.888
<i>The two Cherry Blossom Rings
make up one set.</i>

15:45.515 --> 15:48.521
<i>Each pair is made up of a different alloy.</i>

15:49.230 --> 15:52.319
<i>When the electromagnetic waves resonate,</i>

15:52.319 --> 15:55.868
<i>we can feel
each other's heartbeats and breathing.</i>

15:56.369 --> 15:58.289
<i>One can tell if the other is alive.</i>

15:59.458 --> 16:04.343
<i>So if something happens to you and
your ring's responses become sporadic,</i>

16:04.343 --> 16:06.723
<i>I'll send my heartbeat through my ring.</i>

16:07.182 --> 16:10.105
<i>When my heartbeat reaches your ring,</i>

16:10.105 --> 16:12.652
<i>it will then be able to…</i>

16:20.877 --> 16:22.964
<i>awaken my blood inside you!</i>

16:25.553 --> 16:28.183
I see. So it doesn't just inflict damage.

16:28.183 --> 16:31.147
It's a Blooming that bolsters
your defensive power and protects you.

16:31.648 --> 16:33.484
What an amateurish skill.

16:33.986 --> 16:34.863
<i>I get it.</i>

16:35.155 --> 16:37.535
<i>Mutsumi is going to help me to survive!</i>

16:38.537 --> 16:43.004
<i>That's how it's always been 'til now!
Always, always…</i>

16:46.010 --> 16:48.348
<i>Thanks, Mutsumi.</i>

16:50.143 --> 16:53.692
Kawashita… I admit that in a way,

16:53.692 --> 16:56.907
you might have been
at the mercy of the Yozakuras.

16:57.992 --> 16:58.827
But…

16:59.621 --> 17:01.541
that's not how I see it.

17:02.627 --> 17:05.591
All the more if you insist
that we're the same.

17:07.804 --> 17:10.518
The reason I can keep
getting back on my feet…

17:19.201 --> 17:21.832
is because there's a future…

17:26.424 --> 17:27.885
where Mutsumi and I are alive!

17:27.885 --> 17:29.514
"DAYBREAK"

17:48.677 --> 17:49.512
All right.

17:50.765 --> 17:54.564
The Seed-Sowing Project
has been thwarted!

18:05.001 --> 18:06.797
You really did a number on it, huh?

18:07.674 --> 18:10.303
But that won't hinder my plan.

18:11.013 --> 18:12.432
Kawashita?

18:13.309 --> 18:16.399
I absorbed the Hazakura
before it was deactivated.

18:16.817 --> 18:20.073
I've essentially
taken the Hazakura tanks' place.

18:21.283 --> 18:24.707
Now if I just self-destruct
via a detonation-style Blooming…

18:25.208 --> 18:27.588
the Seed-Sowing Project
will be a success!

18:30.218 --> 18:32.472
No way am I letting you do that!

18:38.109 --> 18:40.113
It's no use, Taiyo.

18:40.781 --> 18:42.325
Die with me.

18:46.793 --> 18:48.296
Are you all right, Taiyo?

18:49.047 --> 18:51.260
Whoa! What kind of a monster is that?

18:51.762 --> 18:54.475
The Hazakura concentration in the air
is abnormally high!

18:55.018 --> 18:58.567
Shion, analyze the enemy
and come up with a way to capture him.

18:58.567 --> 18:59.527
<i>Roger that!</i>

19:02.617 --> 19:04.871
He looks the right size
to be worth tossing.

19:06.917 --> 19:07.752
You guys!

19:08.545 --> 19:09.756
Yozakura…

19:13.471 --> 19:14.933
Good job hanging in there, Taiyo.

19:15.851 --> 19:18.941
This is now
an all-siblings-on-deck battle.

19:20.193 --> 19:22.030
He sure blew up big time.

19:22.030 --> 19:23.449
Growth spurt, maybe?

19:23.951 --> 19:26.455
I wonder if I can take him out.

19:26.957 --> 19:29.169
Actually, he looks
easier to hurl this way.

19:29.671 --> 19:33.135
He looks like Tennou in our yard,
doesn't he? Stylish!

19:34.179 --> 19:38.437
Don't tell me he absorbed
all of the Hazakura in the tanks!

19:38.939 --> 19:41.987
Right, I've detected
an absurdly high level of Hazakura

19:41.987 --> 19:43.991
in that cyst on his right shoulder.

19:43.991 --> 19:45.953
Apparently, he's going
to fuse it all together

19:45.953 --> 19:47.330
and blast it around all at once.

19:47.330 --> 19:50.713
If you can destroy it before that happens,
we'll have won.

19:51.422 --> 19:52.424
At any rate…

19:52.800 --> 19:54.846
<i>I'm wishing you all the best of luck!</i>

19:57.935 --> 19:59.354
So you're all here now.

19:59.689 --> 20:01.610
Are you all right, Taiyo?

20:01.610 --> 20:03.362
Take a little break now.

20:03.362 --> 20:06.327
Hey! Big Bro Kyoichiro!
What he needs now is rest!

20:06.870 --> 20:10.084
This is the best way to deal
with Blooming's resonance.

20:10.586 --> 20:14.761
It seems like the Yozakura blood inside
him is affecting him in an adverse way.

20:14.761 --> 20:17.474
I've only ever seen
cases like this in the records.

20:18.351 --> 20:20.856
To be on the safe side,
no Blooming for any of us.

20:20.856 --> 20:22.860
We're going with Formation Nirvana.

20:23.361 --> 20:25.239
What a blast from the past!

20:26.701 --> 20:30.166
Aim for the cyst and pile on
as many attacks as you can.

20:30.166 --> 20:32.003
Make him deplete all that Hazakura!

20:32.755 --> 20:37.974
Hazakura isn't so feeble that it can
be destroyed by a cheap trick like that.

20:38.224 --> 20:40.061
Come on, Shinzo.

20:40.061 --> 20:40.938
Right.

20:48.494 --> 20:49.914
Counting on you, Kengo!

20:49.914 --> 20:50.833
Gotcha!

20:50.833 --> 20:53.003
Kengo-chan Mutating Super-Alloy Mode!

20:53.421 --> 20:54.757
Kengo Stars!

20:58.305 --> 21:02.105
No matter how many
of these pebbles you-

21:04.694 --> 21:08.242
My poison, seeping through the holes
Big Bro Kengo made,

21:08.242 --> 21:10.329
will stop you in your tracks.

21:10.329 --> 21:11.165
It's all…

21:14.797 --> 21:17.511
so that the blow
that Big Bro Kyoichiro unleashed

21:17.511 --> 21:20.349
and that Big Sis perfected
will land on you for sure!

21:31.915 --> 21:33.627
Sorry about that, Futaba.

21:33.627 --> 21:34.837
I don't mind at all.

21:35.213 --> 21:37.551
Did you do something?

21:37.802 --> 21:40.933
Something's off. Even after taking
all that poison and those blows,

21:40.933 --> 21:43.020
I'm not seeing any Hazakura depletion.

21:43.437 --> 21:45.984
It's concentrating even faster,
as if nothing happened.

21:54.836 --> 21:56.255
Big Bro Kyoichiro!

22:04.814 --> 22:07.443
<i>Kyoichiro!
He's going to blow up any second now!</i>

22:07.443 --> 22:08.613
I'm aware of that.

22:08.613 --> 22:10.158
We'll finish him off
with our next move.

22:10.826 --> 22:12.078
Formation…

22:12.580 --> 22:13.790
Sakura Roots.

22:15.251 --> 22:16.295
Our axis…

22:18.800 --> 22:20.136
will be Taiyo!

23:51.611 --> 23:52.195
NEXT TIME

23:52.821 --> 23:55.994
MISSION COMPLETE / RECEPTION
